\u00e4ltetechnik) spielerisch entdecken und erste berufstypische Aufgaben ausprobieren. Ob Technik, Gesundheit oder Handwerk \u2013 finde heraus, was dir am meisten Spa\u00df macht! :)\n\nEarly Access: Sei unter den Ersten, die jobVRiety testen!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "3902217326706597", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_3902217330039930_1240378813803928232_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TayP2KhkrmMQ7kNvwGvKL5x&_nc_oc=AdpJTqP_MhRJa9tPD2kh-GQbMn-R3KAPpRjfVxsJSTRkeeQoWf2LjQDCSW6oRIo0JwY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQV7jftpbJcXBbYgv-8RZh85pUqXklb4V-wH-XiOHazO7Q&oe=6B0EFDF6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_1080x360.png", "id": "3076099412552471", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825091_3076099415885804_5417180118801740963_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x0d0zVHShCcQ7kNvwHo074q&_nc_oc=AdoPz6nu7T-94niJ5H0vUEPCsIkTpWzQVGVmeqoSoG9bT1XRt3WMHk7E3386R7XtEGo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVBP_uG6kFsa6RFrY0g3HbEbyxFu0Aw0Nf79tuT-ERMTQ&oe=6B0EF9F6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateSquare_1440x1440.png", "id": "2448391595528830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824609_2448391598862163_943533169723644988_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8eLBv08fOlkQ7kNvwECZNp8&_nc_oc=AdoJpsiY3NgbguFqfDqEvsSOwS3DQZoS5OkwPEXT0C-N7sp9h7scCkJtQzYMXOkjLFE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUBKB1tZkVg_8NEhBMlIxy6uPar7_T7RThgK7uZi5mFug&oe=6B0EFE7E"}, {"file_name": "JobVR_LogoClaim_rgb.png", "id": "1748084809102207", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "u